{"id":"vod_hh_137522","vodId":"137522","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"无爱之战","name_cn":"无爱之战","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第12集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/8904f263d36ad96a2d26a0cb5150c631.jpg"},"summary":"在未来的近似日本的社会里，人类以一种特殊的方式生存着：在年幼时，长着可爱的猫耳朵和尾巴，一旦成年，猫耳和尾巴就会消失。青柳立夏是一个小学六年级的少年，唯一能理解他的兄长青柳清明被谋杀。而如今，一个名叫我妻草灯号称“战斗机”的男子出现在他面前。原来，战斗机是守护在号称“牺牲者”的主人身边，通过主人的口语战斗的存在，由于清明已经死去，清明命令草灯就将立夏作为新的主人。在草灯的帮助下，立夏得知了哥哥被名为“七之月”的神秘组织所杀害。为找到真相，立夏成为了草灯的“牺牲者”，两人一同展开了战斗。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-07-07 15:18:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b68BR6Le/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dG6M55rb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epYkQQXa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eZ6zV42e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aQW601Md/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dyP9rrzb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ejR0qqYe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erkmR0Ba/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aKrLZOle/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elY25O7a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aADMPn7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集完结","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erkmR0ka/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:58.449Z"}